          "text": "单节点离线部署UPF / 检查upf 业务网络地址配置 / 配置UPF各个接口地址\ncurl -H \"Content-Type:application/json\" -H \"User-Agent: okhttp/3.6.0\" -H \"Host: ns1.upf-1.com\" -X POST -d '{ADD UpfIntfAddrConfig : InterfaceId = \"3\", InterfaceType = \"N3\", IPAddressType = \"IPv4\", IPv4Address = \"100.10.1.50\", IPv4Mask = \"255.255.255.0\", VRFEnable = \"OFF\";}' 127.0.0.1",
